  <out>
    NoResult
  </out>
</mpy>

codex
Concrete execution reached the loop but exposed one list-sort ambiguity in `Call`: K inferred the argument variable as the whole expression-list rather than its sole expression. The state trace confirms initialization, assignment, and comparison sequencing are otherwise working; I’m making the singleton argument pattern explicit.
